name: Tarot Merchant — tarot shop freq
author: corpus
description: >-
  Tarot Merchant makes Tarot cards appear 2x more frequently in the shop. First-shop tarot
  engine: pair with Fortune Teller, The Emperor, and The Fool.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: TarotMerchant
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: FortuneTeller
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - tarotCard: TheEmperor
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - tarotCard: TheFool
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
